#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:11 abb6d11774e743239a926195a725d129
msgid ""
"For plotting log file data versus time, 3D earth track of flight,access to "
"parameters,etc."
msgstr "用于绘制日志数据随时间变化的曲线、3D 地球轨迹、访问参数等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:16 f3a28431ea674b4e998440b9eb42e648
msgid ""
"`Hardware Report "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/HardwareReport/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Hardware Report "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/HardwareReport/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:17 c43dcb1a078b42a5a11f0ec7505fbcd6
msgid ""
"Provides a overview of connected hardware from a parameter file or log. If a"
" log is used, more information can be provided, such as sensor health status"
" and exact firmware version. A range of options are available to extract "
"mission, lua scripts used, and parameters from logs: all, only changed, or "
"minimal removing calibration parameters. Includes visualization for sensor "
"position offsets."
msgstr ""
"从参数文件或日志提供所连接硬件的概览。使用日志时可提供更多信息，如传感器健康状态和确切固件版本。提供多种选项从日志中提取任务、Lua "
"脚本和参数：全部、仅变更项或最小集（排除校准参数）。包含传感器位置偏移的可视化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:22 e57cb51832384b639d67cad5d25e5d6a
msgid "`MAGFit <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__"
msgstr "`MAGFit <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:23 139ae8d2c80b48238d4739642fdf4398
msgid ""
"Used to calibrate or fine tune calibration of compass from flight log. This "
"tool fits the logged magnetometer data to the world magnetic model providing"
" offsets, iron correction, scale, motor compensation and checks for proper "
"orientation."
msgstr ""
"用于从飞行日志对罗盘进行校准或精细调参。该工具将记录的磁力计数据拟合到世界磁场模型，提供偏移量、铁质校正、比例、电机补偿，并检查安装方向是否正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:28 618bd0419b15484ea10e99758389d872
msgid ""
"`Filter Review "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Filter Review "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:29 070f13eed78b474b9b149710c354d941
msgid ""
"Gyro noise and filter configuration tool. Uses raw or batch IMU logs to show"
" the vehicle's noise profile. Filters can be applied to logged pre-filter "
"data to see the effect without the need to fly again. Advanced user tool, "
"more instructions on use coming."
msgstr ""
"陀螺仪噪声和滤波器配置工具。使用原始或批量 IMU "
"日志显示飞行器的噪声分布。可将滤波器应用于记录的预滤波数据以预览效果，无需再次飞行。高级用户工具，更多使用说明待补充。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:34 4ccb05079c804be6bae0d74a5efd2d21
msgid ""
"`Filter Tool <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterTool/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Filter Tool <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterTool/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:35 102d0032affe419db599da113658fe2b
msgid ""
"Bode plot tool to give insight into gyro low pass and notch filter setup. "
"This tool visualizes the attenuation and phase lag of a filter setup loaded "
"from a parameter file. For filter setup the FilterReview tool it is "
"recommended it provides the same bode plot feedback. This filter tool allows"
" the attenuation and phase lag of each filter to be plotted individually, "
"something which the filter review tool cannot do. This tool also provides a "
"estimated response for the rate PID gains. Advance user tool."
msgstr ""
"波特图工具，用于了解陀螺仪低通滤波器和陷波滤波器的设置。该工具将从参数文件加载的滤波器设置的衰减和相位滞后可视化。建议使用 FilterReview "
"工具进行滤波器设置，它提供相同的波特图反馈。本工具还可单独绘制每个滤波器的衰减和相位滞后，这是 FilterReview "
"工具无法做到的。该工具还提供角速度 PID 增益的估计响应。高级用户工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:40 ab3f8c4bd06c4dd98b15da802c721d0d
msgid ""
"`PID Review <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/PIDReview/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`PID Review <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/PIDReview/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-webtools.rst:41 62d982a2bcc54648b4b496c71a2438ae
msgid ""
"Review PID tune in the frequency domain. Step response estimate is "
"generated. Results are split based on parameter changes. Advance user tool."
msgstr "在频域中评审 PID 调参效果。生成阶跃响应估计。结果根据参数变化拆分。高级用户工具。"
